== Origin

This add-on is based on the Balboa binding written by Carl Önnheim
(https://github.com/carlonnheim/openhab-addons/tree/balboa). ddempsey3 updated that binding for openHAB 3.0 in
December 2020. It was ported to openHAB 5.2 and extended by Larsen-Locke. The code remains under the Eclipse Public
License 2.0, and the license headers of the source files are kept as they are.
